WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:33.696
Can three strong results make a weak list?

00:00:33.696 --> 00:01:15.623
A strong match can leave room for other aspects

00:01:15.623 --> 00:01:54.028
Diversity, reranking and deduplication ask different questions

00:01:54.028 --> 00:02:31.529
A diverse display does not replace high recall

00:02:31.529 --> 00:03:04.897
The second pass has a documented budget

00:03:04.897 --> 00:03:42.843
Follow Primo’s candidates from question to shortlist

00:03:42.843 --> 00:04:11.538
Five abstracts are the evidence passed onward

00:04:11.538 --> 00:04:52.333
What survives each stage?
